    <briefdescription>
<para>Analytical term-structure fitting parameter <formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula>. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="294">$ \varphi(t) $</formula> is analytically defined by <formula id="301">\[ \varphi(t) = f(t) - \frac{2k\theta(e^{th}-1)}{2h+(k+h)(e^{th}-1)} - \frac{4 x_0 h^2 e^{th}}{(2h+(k+h)(e^{th}-1))^1}, \]</formula> where <formula id="302">$ f(t) $</formula> is the instantaneous forward rate at <formula id="147">$ t $</formula> and <formula id="303">$ h = \sqrt{k^2 + 2\sigma^2} $</formula>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
